// A select over a value a `$` still owes its type: the select fixed the
// map's value cell at bottom before the `$` gave it i64, and the program
// was refused "_ does not contain i64" (soak nov24b, a block-wrap flip).
// Expected trace (both engines): 7.
{ let v = [{"a" => { let t = cast<i64>(u32:7); t }$}]; select v { [m] => m{"a"}$, _ => 0 } }
